Hi Janet and Darren,

Thank you for this morning's review. I'm sending the record and the day-to-da=
y routing sheet so the people receiving requests have the same handoff before=
 the July visit.

Darren will take routine procedure questions. Janet will receive roster and d=
estination changes. For a reconciliation discrepancy, please send it to Darre=
n, who will bring Divya in. Caleb and Nora remain the JDH contacts for night-=
duty acceptance and billing returns. If the next person has not accepted a ha=
ndoff, the current duty contact keeps the request; the send record and the re=
ceiving person's callback should be recorded separately. Contract questions c=
an still come to me.

The first group of 36 remains assigned. The other 24 remain on hold: Janet wi=
ll check with Caleb and Nora on July 8 for the named substitute's acceptance,=
 and we will keep the hold through the subsequent rehearsal. The remaining re=
mote session is reserved for that rehearsal; we have not set its date. The ex=
ceptions workbook tracks the outstanding night billing handoff separately fro=
m the review record.

At the July visit, let's check how the support contacts are working in practi=
ce. Please use the attached routing sheet in the meantime and let me know if =
a request reaches the wrong person.

Thanks,
Michelle

